WEBVTT

01:40.070 --> 01:43.009
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.120 --> 01:45.870
[Episode 18]

02:00.190 --> 02:01.390
This is where

02:01.390 --> 02:02.920
Cheng Huang took us before,

02:04.870 --> 02:07.450
and further on is the dangerous Wilderness,

02:07.880 --> 02:09.680
the place of birth of all demons.

02:09.910 --> 02:10.470
Well...

02:11.190 --> 02:12.240
The Wilderness?

02:12.720 --> 02:15.070
It sounds like a desolate area.

02:15.190 --> 02:15.990
Yes.

02:16.870 --> 02:19.180
That's why all demons yearn for the mortal world.

02:19.180 --> 02:20.860
But as Ran Yi said,

02:21.280 --> 02:22.829
it is our eternal hometown.

02:22.829 --> 02:23.630
Brother Zhuo,

02:26.030 --> 02:27.670
where is the Huaijiang Valley?

02:27.670 --> 02:29.480
Mountain God Ying Zhao said

02:29.829 --> 02:31.690
we could find the Yao Water there.

02:31.870 --> 02:32.670
Yes.

02:33.150 --> 02:34.910
Baize's water

02:35.020 --> 02:36.420
can moisten everything.

02:36.950 --> 02:39.010
It can make the withered wood reborn.

02:39.190 --> 02:40.520
So,

02:40.990 --> 02:42.720
as long as we find the Yao Water,

02:42.829 --> 02:44.490
we can repair the Baize Token.

02:46.150 --> 02:47.750
Let's look for the Yao Water first

02:47.750 --> 02:49.150
and then the Divine Wood.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.829
I have to

02:52.510 --> 02:53.910
remind you.

02:55.110 --> 02:55.710
What?

02:57.070 --> 02:59.870
Huaijiang Valley is not a place that has Yao Water,

03:00.190 --> 03:02.390
but also a place where Li Lun was sealed.

03:04.710 --> 03:06.920
He grew up there.

03:56.950 --> 03:58.150
I didn't expect that

03:58.270 --> 04:00.270
we can use the Shanhai Portal again.

04:00.420 --> 04:01.150
Great Demon,

04:01.300 --> 04:03.620
have you ever been there?

04:08.110 --> 04:08.590
Hey.

04:09.110 --> 04:09.840
Great Demon,

04:10.030 --> 04:12.010
did you think of the wrong place?

04:12.310 --> 04:14.230
Did you think of the Demon Hunting Bureau?

04:14.230 --> 04:16.430
Why did the Shanhai Portal send us back?

05:13.670 --> 05:14.360
No.

05:15.040 --> 05:16.520
We're not in the Demon Hunting Bureau

05:16.520 --> 05:18.190
but the dreamland of Li Lun.

05:18.220 --> 05:21.090
The Yao Water has dried up.

05:18.270 --> 05:26.070
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

05:21.310 --> 05:24.350
The last Yao Water

05:24.350 --> 05:25.670
is in my hands.

05:26.270 --> 05:27.950
If you want it,

05:27.950 --> 05:29.630
come and get it.

05:30.590 --> 05:31.750
Where is Wen Xiao?

05:32.550 --> 05:34.700
She is with me.

05:35.180 --> 05:37.790
Come in to find her.

05:42.240 --> 05:43.900
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

05:54.680 --> 05:59.320
[Demon Hunting Bureau]

06:08.820 --> 06:11.550
This place is the same as the Demon Hunting Bureau.

06:11.550 --> 06:13.750
Unfortunately, without the Truth Eye,

06:14.230 --> 06:15.830
I can't break the dreamland.

06:19.510 --> 06:20.600
So scary!

06:20.790 --> 06:22.480
What's that sound?

06:24.570 --> 06:26.030
Let's find Wen Xiao first.

06:27.770 --> 06:28.700
Brother Zhuo,

06:29.000 --> 06:30.680
take it with you.

06:31.600 --> 06:33.630
There must be something wrong with this sound.

06:33.630 --> 06:34.590
Don't listen.

07:41.480 --> 07:42.270
Miss.

07:43.159 --> 07:43.950
Miss.

07:44.970 --> 07:45.960
Sir.

07:46.670 --> 07:47.870
Little boy.

07:49.390 --> 07:50.920
Why is there a little girl?

08:05.990 --> 08:07.250
Little pagoda spirit,

08:07.560 --> 08:08.910
you're in our way.

08:09.670 --> 08:10.930
I know.

08:11.190 --> 08:12.980
But my boss told me

08:13.030 --> 08:15.050
you have to play a game with me.

08:15.310 --> 08:16.300
If you win,

08:16.680 --> 08:18.070
I'll let you go.

08:18.720 --> 08:20.400
If you lose,

08:21.030 --> 08:22.230
I'll eat you.

08:24.550 --> 08:25.350
Okay.

08:26.790 --> 08:28.520
How do you want to play the game?

08:28.590 --> 08:29.680
I heard

08:29.700 --> 08:31.820
lying is human nature.

08:32.429 --> 08:34.419
I want you to prove

08:34.450 --> 08:35.850
that the saying is wrong.

08:37.429 --> 08:38.650
I can be the first one.

08:38.990 --> 08:40.080
You all should

08:40.900 --> 08:42.150
listen to Mr. Zhuo.

08:43.789 --> 08:45.310
Don't waste time.

08:45.470 --> 08:47.110
If she doesn't let us go over,

08:47.600 --> 08:49.660
I'll pull this tree out.

08:50.400 --> 08:51.570
It's useless.

08:52.510 --> 08:54.390
She's just a pagoda tree branch.

08:54.880 --> 08:56.310
Even if we kill her,

08:56.870 --> 08:58.800
there will be more pagoda spirits.

08:59.200 --> 09:01.510
We will be trapped in this dreamland forever.

09:01.510 --> 09:02.560
What should we do?

09:03.710 --> 09:05.640
Are we going to play games with her?

09:06.070 --> 09:07.480
Ridiculous!

09:14.660 --> 09:15.410
No.

09:20.030 --> 09:21.050
Go ahead.

09:22.650 --> 09:23.330
Okay.

09:23.950 --> 09:25.350
Mt question is that

09:26.230 --> 09:27.380
are you a human

09:27.710 --> 09:28.380
or a demon?

09:31.150 --> 09:32.970
What a ridiculous question!

09:33.070 --> 09:34.270
Of course I'm a human.

09:35.590 --> 09:37.050
You're honest.

09:37.200 --> 09:38.360
Pass.

09:39.040 --> 09:39.840
Next.

09:53.160 --> 09:53.920
Go ahead.

09:54.350 --> 09:55.610
What's your question?

09:55.750 --> 09:57.230
Are you a human

09:57.590 --> 09:58.350
or a demon?

09:59.970 --> 10:01.630
Don't you change the problem?

10:01.660 --> 10:02.670
None of your business.

10:02.670 --> 10:03.550
Answer me.

10:04.820 --> 10:06.070
It's obvious.

10:06.620 --> 10:07.770
I'm a demon.

10:09.630 --> 10:10.430
Good.

10:13.910 --> 10:14.970
The same question?

10:15.620 --> 10:16.700
Yes.

10:18.270 --> 10:18.950
Human.

10:19.190 --> 10:19.950
Good.

10:20.720 --> 10:21.710
The last one.

10:41.410 --> 10:42.670
Sit tight.

10:48.750 --> 10:49.870
Are you a human

10:50.450 --> 10:51.310
or a demon?

10:53.470 --> 10:55.330
Why did you ask the same question?

10:55.630 --> 10:56.750
It's so boring.

10:58.080 --> 10:59.870
Why don't you change to an interesting one?

10:59.870 --> 11:02.070
This is the most interesting question.

11:02.190 --> 11:04.120
I don't want to change my question.

11:04.340 --> 11:05.280
Answer me.

11:05.910 --> 11:06.950
Are you a human

11:07.390 --> 11:08.200
or a demon?

11:16.580 --> 11:17.200
I

11:19.700 --> 11:20.510
am…

11:21.070 --> 11:21.910
I'm a human.

11:33.370 --> 11:34.820
Someone's lying!

11:38.560 --> 11:39.970
Mr. Zhuo, help me!

11:48.310 --> 11:50.370
Looks like you have something to say.

11:54.580 --> 11:56.130
I have a question.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.600
Don't worry.

12:00.800 --> 12:02.090
I won't kill you.

12:04.510 --> 12:06.430
I'm not worried about that.

12:09.090 --> 12:09.690
Huh?

12:10.670 --> 12:12.400
You hate Zhao Yuanzhou so much.

12:13.040 --> 12:15.840
So, you will definitely torture me in front of him.

12:15.860 --> 12:17.910
But you arrested me alone.

12:18.660 --> 12:19.940
Obviously,

12:20.370 --> 12:22.380
you didn't intend to kill me.

12:24.340 --> 12:26.530
So, I want to see

12:27.280 --> 12:29.090
what you're going to do.

12:31.910 --> 12:32.910
Brother Zhuo!

12:34.390 --> 12:35.440
Let him out,

12:35.600 --> 12:37.720
or I'll chop you into pieces and burn you.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.410
Liars are the worst.

12:39.470 --> 12:41.090
They should be eaten.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.160
I didn't.

12:42.800 --> 12:43.310
I didn't expect

12:43.310 --> 12:45.750
Little Bunny is hiding something from us.

12:46.870 --> 12:47.830
Great Demon!

12:47.830 --> 12:48.870
Don't talk nonsense.

12:48.870 --> 12:50.430
Wen has golden pupils.

12:50.570 --> 12:52.090
If I were a demon,

12:52.120 --> 12:53.720
how can I hide it from her?

12:55.930 --> 12:57.240
In the vast Wilderness,

12:57.240 --> 12:58.700
there are so many wonders.

12:58.900 --> 12:59.670
Maybe there is a demon

12:59.670 --> 13:02.870
who can conceal his identity from Golden Pupils of Baize.

13:07.120 --> 13:08.310
Mr. Zhuo,

13:08.920 --> 13:10.930
you suspected me

13:13.340 --> 13:15.340
when we were in the Sinan Water Town.

13:16.790 --> 13:18.650
It's useless asking for his help.

13:18.950 --> 13:21.210
Mr. Zhuo has always been strict and fair.

13:22.830 --> 13:24.920
Don't pick a pushover to bully.

13:27.110 --> 13:28.250
I am not a pushover.

13:32.090 --> 13:32.880
Jiu.

13:33.710 --> 13:34.510
Tell me.

13:35.350 --> 13:36.300
Are you

13:36.330 --> 13:37.810
hiding anything from us?

13:43.720 --> 13:44.690
Brother Zhuo,

13:48.110 --> 13:49.510
I'm not a demon.

14:08.790 --> 14:09.590
Okay.

14:13.770 --> 14:14.840
Mr. Zhuo,

14:15.550 --> 14:16.880
do you trust me?

14:22.340 --> 14:24.200
I only trust my Cloud Light Sword.

14:39.540 --> 14:44.830
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

14:44.940 --> 14:50.120
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

14:51.830 --> 14:57.090
♫There're no worries in its eyes♫

14:57.260 --> 15:02.510
♫It just wants to sleep on a roof♫

15:03.420 --> 15:06.360
♫The bell jingles and sways♫

15:06.460 --> 15:09.330
♫Thoughts circle back and forth♫

15:09.880 --> 15:15.070
♫Who can truly understand the essence of growing up?♫

15:15.710 --> 15:19.250
♫Life is grand♫

15:19.640 --> 15:22.020
♫Yet so small♫

15:19.800 --> 15:21.440
It seems that Jiu is a human.

15:22.240 --> 15:23.420
If he were a demon,

15:22.520 --> 15:27.090
♫I hope everything is fine♫

15:23.700 --> 15:26.030
the Cloud Light Sword would have reacted.

15:26.780 --> 15:28.510
I'm not a demon.

15:28.910 --> 15:30.790
But you lied.

15:35.710 --> 15:37.630
It makes sense.

15:38.510 --> 15:39.370
Zhao Yuanzhou,

15:39.790 --> 15:40.790
stop it.

15:40.970 --> 15:42.020
Okay.

15:43.280 --> 15:45.270
I was just joking

15:45.290 --> 15:46.690
since you're so nervous.

15:47.310 --> 15:49.270
I know Little Bunny is not a demon.

15:49.870 --> 15:53.070
No demon can hide the Golden Pupil of the Goddess of Baize.

15:53.990 --> 15:54.910
unless...

15:54.910 --> 15:55.840
What?

16:00.540 --> 16:01.500
Nothing.

16:01.970 --> 16:03.040
Since then,

16:03.780 --> 16:04.870
the liar is

16:06.210 --> 16:08.080
the demon.

16:10.680 --> 16:11.490
Jiu.

16:12.580 --> 16:13.390
Step back.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.150
Okay.

16:35.640 --> 16:36.800
Mr. Zhuo!

16:36.840 --> 16:38.500
You really trust me this time?

16:44.340 --> 16:45.660
You're right.

16:46.560 --> 16:48.020
Indeed, someone is lying.

16:48.640 --> 16:50.280
But it's not the four of us.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.200
It's you.

17:01.730 --> 17:03.060
It's your turn.

17:03.820 --> 17:05.040
Are you

17:05.300 --> 17:06.970
human or a demon?

17:08.109 --> 17:09.599
Of course, I'm a demon.

17:21.349 --> 17:22.400
You cheated.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.599
You're playing dirty.

17:23.599 --> 17:25.730
You were the one who started cheating.

17:25.750 --> 17:28.410
This pagoda tree is clearly under your control.

17:28.430 --> 17:30.390
You're trying to sow discord among us,

17:30.390 --> 17:32.590
and you always pick the softest target.

17:33.840 --> 17:35.970
Didn't you just say the softest target

17:36.160 --> 17:37.770
was Mr. Zhuo?

17:39.680 --> 17:40.400
Ah.

17:43.750 --> 17:44.550
Retract.

18:08.970 --> 18:10.830
What were you just about to ask?

18:16.630 --> 18:18.390
Your true form is a pagoda tree.

18:19.350 --> 18:20.620
Then tell me,

18:20.710 --> 18:22.240
are you a demon or a monster?

18:27.310 --> 18:28.760
You asked me to ask,

18:29.590 --> 18:31.320
But when I do, you don't answer.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.310
What's wrong?

18:33.630 --> 18:35.590
Afraid I'll uncover your secrets?

18:45.980 --> 18:50.180
Pagoda trees are naturally prone to attracting dark and malicious energy.

18:50.870 --> 18:52.150
Since ancient times,

18:53.830 --> 18:55.720
we've been called ghost trees.

18:59.000 --> 19:00.130
Oh,

19:01.030 --> 19:01.950
I understand.

19:03.070 --> 19:04.150
No wonder,

19:04.170 --> 19:06.500
the books record you as the Pagoda Spirit.

19:07.510 --> 19:08.310
Alright.

19:08.750 --> 19:09.830
Next question.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.250
Bring it on.

19:13.870 --> 19:15.280
About this rattle drum,

19:16.240 --> 19:17.740
what's its origin?

19:23.660 --> 19:25.190
Zhao Yuanzhou gave it to me.

19:26.470 --> 19:27.280
As expected.

19:30.640 --> 19:31.730
You know it?

19:34.040 --> 19:35.740
Did Zhao Yuanzhou tell you?

19:36.480 --> 19:39.410
I saw it in the illusion of the Cheng Huang's sundial.

19:46.970 --> 19:49.480
I want to play with the rattle drum!

19:51.030 --> 19:52.430
I want to play with the rattle drum!

19:52.430 --> 19:54.420
Be good. I'll take you home first.

19:54.830 --> 19:58.710
I want to play the rattle drum.

20:03.510 --> 20:04.310
Boss,

20:05.340 --> 20:06.210
how much is this?

20:06.210 --> 20:07.210
Five coins.

20:09.550 --> 20:09.950
Be good.

20:09.950 --> 20:10.490
Be a good boy.

20:10.490 --> 20:12.370
Let's go home now, alright?

20:12.400 --> 20:16.510
No, I want to play with the rattle drum!

20:17.110 --> 20:18.470
Little one,

20:18.790 --> 20:19.670
do you like it?

20:20.910 --> 20:21.750
Take it.

20:21.750 --> 20:22.910
Thank you, Brother.

20:22.910 --> 20:23.350
Don't cry anymore.

20:23.350 --> 20:23.990
Thank you.

20:46.630 --> 20:48.070
What's

20:48.070 --> 20:49.070
this thing for?

20:52.170 --> 20:53.470
In the Wilderness,

20:53.670 --> 20:55.070
we can do many things

20:55.350 --> 20:56.510
with just a blink

20:56.510 --> 20:58.230
or a breath.

20:59.000 --> 21:00.330
But in the mortal world,

21:00.620 --> 21:03.750
there are treasures that can achieve great things with minimal effort.

21:03.750 --> 21:05.400
Can you make others

21:05.630 --> 21:07.030
stop crying

21:07.160 --> 21:08.620
and smile?

21:09.640 --> 21:10.700
But it can.

21:16.450 --> 21:18.650
Since you were once friends,

21:19.310 --> 21:20.670
why

21:21.350 --> 21:23.080
did you become mortal enemies?

21:24.910 --> 21:25.950
Friends?

21:31.750 --> 21:34.030
How do you define "friends"?

21:35.910 --> 21:37.550
Sharing joy and sorrow?

21:43.000 --> 21:43.980
Ridiculous.

21:50.970 --> 21:52.190
"Friends" is just

21:52.190 --> 21:54.550
a hypocritical term you mortals use.

21:56.010 --> 21:58.000
Lies, deceit,

21:58.720 --> 22:00.850
betrayal, and slander.

22:03.670 --> 22:06.620
That's what your so-called friends

22:06.670 --> 22:08.310
are capable of.

22:10.120 --> 22:11.780
Is that really what you think?

22:13.190 --> 22:14.920
Then why

22:15.110 --> 22:17.570
are you still holding onto this rattle drum?

22:23.770 --> 22:24.570
Hey.

22:25.540 --> 22:26.150
Zhao Yuanzhou.

22:26.150 --> 22:27.150
Your umbrella.

22:28.090 --> 22:30.150
And that thing beside you.

22:37.870 --> 22:40.400
What game is Li Lun playing with you this time?

22:43.360 --> 22:45.120
A game to take my life.

22:51.070 --> 22:52.770
How much unresolved conflict

22:52.820 --> 22:54.640
is there between you and Li Lun?

22:57.520 --> 22:59.510
You've asked so many questions,

23:00.040 --> 23:01.230
Now it's my turn.

23:04.870 --> 23:05.800
Go ahead and ask.

23:07.060 --> 23:08.890
I have three questions.

23:10.210 --> 23:11.650
Answer them correctly,

23:12.080 --> 23:13.560
and I'll let you go.

23:15.180 --> 23:16.820
What if I get them wrong?

23:17.960 --> 23:19.270
If you get them wrong,

23:22.080 --> 23:24.290
you'll die.

23:30.710 --> 23:32.570
This illusion hasn't broken yet.

23:32.590 --> 23:34.320
Is it because there's something

23:34.320 --> 23:35.580
you've forgotten

23:35.710 --> 23:37.590
but Li Lun wants you to remember?

23:39.320 --> 23:41.180
Seems there really is something.

24:03.470 --> 24:05.030
Has the human world changed this much?

24:05.030 --> 24:07.040
Don't compare it to the Wilderness.

24:07.060 --> 24:08.360
In the Wilderness,

24:08.550 --> 24:11.620
a single cloud can drift in the sky for over two hundred years.

24:11.620 --> 24:12.980
In that case,

24:13.660 --> 24:15.720
the Wilderness is a bit boring, then.

24:18.710 --> 24:19.680
Boss,

24:19.700 --> 24:20.810
how much is this?

24:21.010 --> 24:23.660
Sir, this umbrella is only five coins.

24:28.390 --> 24:30.720
Ying Zhao only gave us five coins in total.

24:30.850 --> 24:32.510
We should spend it sparingly.

24:39.560 --> 24:40.630
It's raining.

24:42.260 --> 24:43.920
So this is called an umbrella,

24:46.830 --> 24:47.870
What is it for?

24:47.980 --> 24:49.310
To shield from the rain.

24:49.760 --> 24:51.160
Why shield from the rain?

24:51.370 --> 24:52.730
Wind and rain,

24:52.760 --> 24:54.140
snow and frost,

24:54.360 --> 24:55.650
everything in this world

24:55.650 --> 24:57.180
follows the natural order.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.470
I, Li Lun,

24:58.830 --> 24:59.950
never hide

25:00.310 --> 25:01.580
or retreat.

25:03.030 --> 25:03.830
Fine.

25:07.560 --> 25:11.860
[Umbrella]

25:31.970 --> 25:33.620
First question,

25:35.510 --> 25:37.610
is it better to be human

25:38.680 --> 25:40.320
or to be a demon?

25:40.670 --> 25:42.000
Being a demon is better.

25:42.390 --> 25:43.320
Being a demon...

25:43.920 --> 25:45.300
Wrong answer.

25:56.030 --> 25:56.990
Being human

25:59.070 --> 26:00.000
and being a demon

26:00.940 --> 26:01.740
both are good.

26:07.600 --> 26:09.080
You can only choose one.

26:11.920 --> 26:13.180
I don't need to choose,

26:14.680 --> 26:17.340
Because the heavens have already chosen for me.

26:19.510 --> 26:20.110
Oh?

26:20.710 --> 26:21.980
I was born human,

26:22.970 --> 26:24.320
so I can only be human.

26:26.490 --> 26:30.020
In truth, both humans and demons have their own good qualities.

26:30.400 --> 26:31.660
No need to envy

26:32.140 --> 26:33.590
or resent each other.

26:34.800 --> 26:36.460
Mountains don't reject dust.

26:36.640 --> 26:38.370
Rivers don't refuse fullness.

26:38.680 --> 26:40.080
Everything in this world

26:40.560 --> 26:41.950
has its place.

26:42.700 --> 26:44.210
Whether human or demon,

26:44.470 --> 26:46.730
what's the difference in value or worth?

26:50.830 --> 26:53.950
The Baize Goddess truly has a way with words.

26:55.890 --> 26:59.640
Since you believe both humans and demons are good,

27:02.080 --> 27:04.280
then let's move on to the next question.

27:05.350 --> 27:07.460
Do you think humans are more evil,

27:09.330 --> 27:11.260
or demons?

27:13.510 --> 27:14.710
Demons are more evil.

27:24.910 --> 27:26.530
Why are demons so wicked?

27:28.980 --> 27:30.330
My father was a good man,

27:32.190 --> 27:33.930
yet he was killed by a demon.

27:37.590 --> 27:39.510
Demons act violently,

27:40.030 --> 27:41.960
without regard for consequences.

27:42.480 --> 27:44.300
But the cause of this

27:44.830 --> 27:45.630
was still because

27:45.630 --> 27:47.470
a demon's love turned to hate,

27:48.480 --> 27:49.790
seeking revenge,

27:50.440 --> 27:53.040
which unfortunately implicated your father.

27:58.330 --> 28:00.750
Are you truly willing to follow me back to the Wilderness,

28:00.750 --> 28:02.610
and devote yourself to training?

28:03.080 --> 28:03.940
I am willing,

28:06.930 --> 28:08.890
Because I don't want anyone else

28:10.200 --> 28:11.200
to lose loved ones

28:12.080 --> 28:13.770
because of demons.

28:16.080 --> 28:18.150
Why did you stop speaking?

28:35.860 --> 28:38.290
Demons come in all shapes and forms,

28:39.670 --> 28:40.940
and their wickedness

28:41.110 --> 28:42.660
is often apparent.

28:43.790 --> 28:45.580
The bloodthirsty kill.

28:45.900 --> 28:47.620
The greedy plunder.

28:48.400 --> 28:50.190
It's an obvious

28:50.390 --> 28:52.560
and blatant kind of evil.

28:53.910 --> 28:54.750
But humans

28:55.220 --> 28:57.120
each have a thousand facets.

28:57.390 --> 28:58.920
We are masters of disguise.

29:00.820 --> 29:02.040
If you're asking

29:02.640 --> 29:03.950
who is more wicked,

29:04.770 --> 29:06.000
then of course,

29:06.990 --> 29:09.030
it's the more overtly evil demons

29:09.050 --> 29:10.180
who are more wicked.

29:12.390 --> 29:14.280
But if you're asking

29:14.500 --> 29:16.860
which type of evil is more dangerous

29:17.030 --> 29:18.710
and insidious,

29:20.950 --> 29:22.310
then that's...

29:25.240 --> 29:27.250
That's the next question.

29:36.080 --> 29:38.270
I quite like your answer.

29:40.580 --> 29:42.450
The final question.

29:45.500 --> 29:47.620
Between me and Zhao Yuanzhou,

29:49.640 --> 29:51.550
who is stronger?

29:58.930 --> 30:01.800
Why did your question style suddenly change?

30:10.710 --> 30:12.070
Answer me.

30:18.350 --> 30:20.300
Zhao Yuanzhou is stronger.

30:25.730 --> 30:27.100
Zhao Yuanzhou

30:28.310 --> 30:30.740
has a broader mind than you.

30:33.890 --> 30:35.290
He is not narrow-minded,

30:36.480 --> 30:37.870
not extreme.

30:40.140 --> 30:42.340
But you, with your twisted intentions,

30:43.870 --> 30:45.890
will never surpass him.

31:03.820 --> 31:05.740
You understand him so well,

31:05.990 --> 31:07.830
and speak on his behalf.

31:09.300 --> 31:11.540
Don't you hate him?

31:12.370 --> 31:15.320
He did kill your master.

31:16.660 --> 31:18.870
You should've been hating him like I do.

31:22.030 --> 31:24.860
We should seek revenge with him,

31:25.730 --> 31:26.720
shouldn't we?

31:32.300 --> 31:34.230
You say he's righteous.

31:37.320 --> 31:40.170
But he's only good at mimicking humanity.

31:41.970 --> 31:44.970
He's more hypocritical and deceitful than any human.

31:46.310 --> 31:47.810
To me,

31:48.270 --> 31:50.150
to Zhao Wan'er and to you,

31:51.420 --> 31:52.890
he's the same.

31:54.590 --> 31:56.580
Sooner or later,

31:58.080 --> 32:01.200
he will kill you just like he killed

32:02.790 --> 32:04.430
Zhao Wan'er.

32:09.350 --> 32:10.830
So,

32:13.060 --> 32:15.760
the one who should be suffering now

32:16.270 --> 32:17.230
is not me,

32:18.480 --> 32:20.030
and not you,

32:22.720 --> 32:24.530
but him.

33:00.420 --> 33:01.570
Li Lun.

33:03.300 --> 33:05.480
How many times have you been deceived?

33:06.800 --> 33:08.360
Why can't you learn from it?

33:32.870 --> 33:33.550
Jiu!

33:33.580 --> 33:34.980
Jiu!

34:08.840 --> 34:10.639
What are you doing, Great Demon?

34:12.520 --> 34:14.370
She's not Wen Xiao.

34:18.350 --> 34:18.909
Wen.

34:18.909 --> 34:19.719
Jiu.

34:39.280 --> 34:40.480
Jiu, are you okay?

34:40.510 --> 34:41.440
I'm fine.

34:41.469 --> 34:42.070
Great Demon.

34:42.070 --> 34:43.480
What's going on?

35:02.830 --> 35:03.760
Wen Xiao.

35:09.830 --> 35:10.770
Open.

35:14.330 --> 35:15.880
This cage

35:16.000 --> 35:17.730
limits my magic.

35:17.950 --> 35:18.650
What?

35:22.740 --> 35:24.580
What is this cage?

35:31.200 --> 35:32.510
On this cage,

35:32.840 --> 35:35.480
there is a curse seal drawn with the blood of bullock.

35:35.480 --> 35:37.610
It's specially used to lock up demons.

35:38.500 --> 35:40.250
The demon inside this cage

35:41.500 --> 35:43.430
can't use any of its demonic power.

35:44.230 --> 35:45.380
What should we do?

35:51.490 --> 35:52.720
Go behind me.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.820
Zhao Yuanzhou.

36:18.840 --> 36:20.550
Long time no see.

36:22.610 --> 36:23.910
Where is Wen Xiao?

36:25.020 --> 36:27.300
The final challenge is not over yet.

36:27.950 --> 36:29.150
What's the rush?

36:30.630 --> 36:31.990
If you pass,

36:33.180 --> 36:34.950
I'll let you see her.

36:39.590 --> 36:40.270
No.

36:41.230 --> 36:42.720
She's not Wen Xiao.

37:09.550 --> 37:11.050
You still want to play?

37:11.190 --> 37:12.190
That's right.

37:14.550 --> 37:15.880
What do you want to play?

37:16.870 --> 37:18.070
This and that.

37:19.860 --> 37:21.410
Choose between the two.

37:31.110 --> 37:32.100
Let him go.

37:34.790 --> 37:36.230
In the first round, I planned to

37:36.230 --> 37:38.620
keep this pagoda spirit here.

37:39.230 --> 37:41.720
I didn't expect you to not give up on him.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.770
Jiu is my friend.

37:45.470 --> 37:47.390
Even if I give up on myself,

37:48.110 --> 37:50.120
I won't give up on my friends.

37:51.170 --> 37:53.280
You won't give up on friends.

37:55.850 --> 37:57.620
You're lying again.

38:00.520 --> 38:01.850
Now,

38:02.460 --> 38:03.890
I want your life

38:04.560 --> 38:05.720
for his life.

38:06.540 --> 38:07.670
Are you willing?

38:14.570 --> 38:15.560
Yes.

38:18.400 --> 38:19.290
Zhao Yuanzhou.

38:20.290 --> 38:22.000
Don't listen to his nonsense.

38:22.920 --> 38:24.650
He is a liar.

38:25.720 --> 38:26.480
Jiu.

38:28.830 --> 38:32.230
Zhao Yuanzhou is the liar.

38:36.320 --> 38:38.420
This or that.

38:39.180 --> 38:40.590
Listen.

38:44.620 --> 38:46.220
Do you choose Bai Jiu

38:47.880 --> 38:49.520
or Zhuo Yichen?

38:51.150 --> 38:52.780
What for?

38:56.140 --> 38:58.200
Choose one to live,

38:59.720 --> 39:01.700
and the other one to die.

39:43.860 --> 39:45.540
Is it hard to choose?

39:46.830 --> 39:48.640
Bai Jiu is your friend.

39:49.830 --> 39:51.540
But Zhuo Yichen...

39:52.670 --> 39:55.160
is your enemy.

40:00.310 --> 40:02.870
M-M-Mr. Zhuo

40:03.640 --> 40:05.150
is not the enemy.

40:13.440 --> 40:15.230
After all these years,

40:17.010 --> 40:19.010
you still haven't improved.

40:20.280 --> 40:23.280
You created the illusion of the Demon Hunting Bureau.

40:25.460 --> 40:27.460
You've really put in a lot of effort.

40:28.880 --> 40:31.280
I just hope you don't forget

40:33.520 --> 40:36.340
how humans treat us.

40:47.030 --> 40:48.890
Luckily, you bought an umbrella.

40:54.470 --> 40:55.150
Listen.

40:58.590 --> 40:59.310
A demon.

41:08.470 --> 41:10.220
How could a normal clinic

41:10.550 --> 41:11.980
has a bunker?

41:19.830 --> 41:21.570
Such a strong smell of blood.

41:58.270 --> 41:59.930
The blood of bullock...

42:04.640 --> 42:05.620
Brother.

42:05.660 --> 42:07.240
Brother, save us...

42:07.360 --> 42:09.080
They captured us

42:09.100 --> 42:10.560
to drain our blood.

42:10.590 --> 42:11.960
But they won't let us die.

42:11.960 --> 42:13.920
Please save us.

42:13.940 --> 42:14.890
Brother...

42:15.570 --> 42:16.690
Save us.

42:16.720 --> 42:17.880
Save us!

42:17.900 --> 42:18.580
Brother!

42:18.610 --> 42:21.790
I don't want to stay here anymore.

42:21.810 --> 42:23.330
Save us.

42:23.360 --> 42:25.600
Save us!

42:25.650 --> 42:26.850
Brother!

42:27.560 --> 42:30.740
Please save us!

42:30.910 --> 42:32.550
Someone's coming.

42:33.220 --> 42:33.910
Save us!

42:33.910 --> 42:34.600
Let's go!

42:35.350 --> 42:36.390
Brother!

42:40.670 --> 42:41.970
It's been such a hard journey.

42:41.970 --> 42:43.430
I finally found the

42:43.430 --> 42:44.760
branch of the Ever-Burning Wood that he wants.

42:44.760 --> 42:45.730
It is said that

42:46.280 --> 42:48.360
this is the last piece of Ever-Burning Wood in the world.

42:48.360 --> 42:49.680
Watch carefully.

42:55.070 --> 42:55.750
Who are you?

43:19.490 --> 43:20.590
Are you crazy?

43:21.170 --> 43:22.370
Why did you kill them?

43:39.320 --> 43:40.550
Come with me.

43:41.980 --> 43:43.780
I'll take you to the Wilderness.

43:55.870 --> 43:58.340
♫A thought in the vicissitudes of time♫

43:58.410 --> 44:02.470
♫Wait until regrets blow all over the desolate world♫

44:02.670 --> 44:04.830
♫The inscription is difficult to read♫

44:05.100 --> 44:08.760
♫Time wears away the vows♫

44:08.960 --> 44:11.400
♫Turning the world upside down♫

44:11.480 --> 44:16.130
♫Can't get the broken yesterday back♫

44:16.580 --> 44:22.190
♫How to turn back time?♫

44:22.280 --> 44:25.150
♫I'm willing to break through the cliff♫

44:25.210 --> 44:28.520
♫Turn into a white horse♫

44:28.900 --> 44:31.590
♫Crush all the struggles♫

44:31.850 --> 44:35.240
♫Let the suffering bloom♫

44:35.900 --> 44:39.180
♫Write about caring with ruthlessness♫

44:39.240 --> 44:42.390
♫Use a lifetime to remember a moment♫

44:42.500 --> 44:48.780
♫The greatness of vowing to live and die together♫
